{"name":"Mad About Magenta","hex":"#94508e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mad","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-2 & ISO 639-3 language code for Madurese."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Insane; crazy; mentally deranged.","Angry; annoyed."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mad"},{"term":"about","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Preposition","definitions":["In a circle around; all round; on every side of; on the outside of; around. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Over or upon different parts of; through or over in various directions; here and there in; to and fro in; throughout."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["On all sides, or in every or any direction from a point; around.","Here and there; around; in one place and another; up and down."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/about"},{"term":"magenta","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color which is close to the equal mixture of red and blue which is an additive secondary color but a subtractive primary color evoked by the combination of red and light blue."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having the color of fuchsia, fuchsine, light purple."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magenta"}],"entries":[{"title":"Magenta","blocks":[{"text":"Magenta is a purplish-pink color. On color wheels of the RGB and CMYK color models, it is located directly midway between blue and red. It is one of the four colors of subtractive ink used in color printing by most color printers, also known as CMYK along with yellow, cyan, and black to make all the other colors and hues. The tone of magenta used in printing, printer's magenta, is redder than the magenta of the RGB (additive) model, the former being closer to rose."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_bird_on_its_head%2C_on_Shinobazu_Pond%2C_Ueno_Park%2C_Tokyo.jpg/330px-Pink_swanboat_hosting_a_real_